# No credentials are needed for analyses of the committed caches.
# Uncomment and fill only the services needed for new generation or API judging.
# Keep unused entries commented: Slurm sources this file, and a blank assignment
# would override a credential inherited from the submitting shell.
# HF_TOKEN=
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GROQ_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
